  "description": "The Flyer is our comfortable and fun cruiser. We designed it to be extremely simple and used trustworthy parts that will keep this bike rolling for years. The classic twin top tube styling allows us to offer a standard version by simply flipping the top tubes during assembly. Sturdy BMX 3pc cranks with a sealed Mid bottom bracket will last a lifetime. A Fairdale front chainwheel powers the relaxed one speed drive train and turns the durable Odyssey 13t freewheel. Front and rear Odyssey brake levers and Odyssey U-brakes provide reliable braking. Odyssey grips on a special riser version of our comfortable Archer bars makes this bike a joy to ride. 26 x 1.9 wide tires keep this bike rolling smooth.\n\nThe Step-through Flyer has a 14.75″ seat tube. Also, Check out the Standard Flyer.\n\nAvailable in White or Army Green.",
